{"entries":[{"id":"scofield-es-2ch-1-3","title":"2 Crónicas 1:3","author":"C. I. Scofield (1843–1921)","reference":{"book":"2CH","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>Introducción al libro - 2 Crónicas Lea el primer capítulo de 2 Crónicas. Este libro continúa la historia que comenzó en Primera de Crónicas. Se divide en dieciocho divisiones, por reinados, desde Salomón hasta los cautiverios; registra la división del reino de David bajo Jeroboam y Roboam, y está marcado por una apostasía cada vez mayor, interrumpida temporalmente por reformas bajo Asa, 14-16; Josafat, 17:1-19; Joás, 24; Ezequías, 29-32; y Josías, 34,35. Pero el estado religioso del pueblo, incluso en el mejor de los casos, se describe en Isaías 1-5. Los acontecimientos registrados en Segunda de Crónicas cubren un período de 427 años. (Usher). hubo (véase Scofield &quot;1 Crónicas 16:37&quot;).</p>","translation":{"sourceId":"scofield-2ch-1-3","status":"official","sourceLanguage":"en","targetLanguage":"es"}},{"id":"scofield-es-2ch-2-4","title":"2 Crónicas 2:4","author":"C. I. Scofield (1843–1921)","reference":{"book":"2CH","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>pan de la proposición (véase Scofield &quot;Éxodo 25:30&quot;).</p>","translation":{"sourceId":"scofield-2ch-2-4","status":"official","sourceLanguage":"en","targetLanguage":"es"}},{"id":"scofield-es-2ch-3-2","title":"2 Crónicas 3:2","author":"C. I. Scofield (1843–1921)","reference":{"book":"2CH","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>segundo mes, es decir, mayo.</p>","translation":{"sourceId":"scofield-2ch-3-2","status":"official","sourceLanguage":"en","targetLanguage":"es"}},{"id":"scofield-es-2ch-4-9","title":"2 Crónicas 4:9","author":"C. I. Scofield (1843–1921)","reference":{"book":"2CH","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>tribunal El tabernáculo no tenía &quot;atrio de sacerdotes&quot;.</p>","translation":{"sourceId":"scofield-2ch-4-9","status":"official","sourceLanguage":"en","targetLanguage":"es"}},{"id":"scofield-es-2ch-4-19","title":"2 Crónicas 4:19","author":"C. I. Scofield (1843–1921)","reference":{"book":"2CH","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>pan de la proposición (véase Scofield &quot;Éxodo 25:30&quot;).</p>","translation":{"sourceId":"scofield-2ch-4-19","status":"official","sourceLanguage":"en","targetLanguage":"es"}},{"id":"scofield-es-2ch-4-20","title":"2 Crónicas 4:20","author":"C. I. Scofield (1843–1921)","reference":{"book":"2CH","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>oráculo (véase Scofield &quot;1 Reyes 6:4&quot;).</p>","translation":{"sourceId":"scofield-2ch-4-20","status":"official","sourceLanguage":"en","targetLanguage":"es"}},{"id":"scofield-es-2ch-5-2","title":"2 Crónicas 5:2","author":"C. I. Scofield (1843–1921)","reference":{"book":"2CH","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>Luego Salomón (véase Scofield &quot;1 Reyes 8:1&quot;).</p>","translation":{"sourceId":"scofield-2ch-5-2","status":"official","sourceLanguage":"en","targetLanguage":"es"}},{"id":"scofield-es-2ch-5-3","title":"2 Crónicas 5:3","author":"C. I. Scofield (1843–1921)","reference":{"book":"2CH","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>séptimo mes, es decir, octubre.</p>","translation":{"sourceId":"scofield-2ch-5-3","status":"official","sourceLanguage":"en","targetLanguage":"es"}},{"id":"scofield-es-2ch-5-13","title":"2 Crónicas 5:13","author":"C. I. Scofield (1843–1921)","reference":{"book":"2CH","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>nube Ver 2 Crónicas 5:11-13. (véase Scofield &quot;Éxodo 40:34&quot;).</p>","translation":{"sourceId":"scofield-2ch-5-13","status":"official","sourceLanguage":"en","targetLanguage":"es"}},{"id":"scofield-es-2ch-6-31","title":"2 Crónicas 6:31","author":"C. I. Scofield (1843–1921)","reference":{"book":"2CH","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":31,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":31},"content":"<p>miedo (véase Scofield &quot;Salmo 19:9&quot;).</p>","translation":{"sourceId":"scofield-2ch-6-31","status":"official","sourceLanguage":"en","targetLanguage":"es"}},{"id":"scofield-es-2ch-7-10","title":"2 Crónicas 7:10","author":"C. I. Scofield (1843–1921)","reference":{"book":"2CH","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>séptimo mes, es decir, octubre.</p>","translation":{"sourceId":"scofield-2ch-7-10","status":"official","sourceLanguage":"en","targetLanguage":"es"}},{"id":"scofield-es-2ch-9-26","title":"2 Crónicas 9:26","author":"C. I. Scofield (1843–1921)","reference":{"book":"2CH","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":26,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":26},"content":"<p>río &quot;El río&quot;, es decir, Éufrates, hasta la frontera de Egipto, pero no hasta el &quot;río de Egipto&quot;. cf. Génesis 15:18 aún por cumplirse:</p>","translation":{"sourceId":"scofield-2ch-9-26","status":"official","sourceLanguage":"en","targetLanguage":"es"}},{"id":"scofield-es-2ch-9-29","title":"2 Crónicas 9:29","author":"C. I. Scofield (1843–1921)","reference":{"book":"2CH","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":29,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":29},"content":"<p>El resto de estos libros han perecido. 1 Reyes 11:29.</p>","translation":{"sourceId":"scofield-2ch-9-29","status":"official","sourceLanguage":"en","targetLanguage":"es"}},{"id":"scofield-es-2ch-10-16","title":"2 Crónicas 10:16","author":"C. I. Scofield (1843–1921)","reference":{"book":"2CH","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>Israel &quot;Israel&quot;, las diez tribus distintas de Judá y Benjamín, a menudo llamadas &quot;Israel&quot; a diferencia de Judá. La división del reino marca una época de gran importancia en la historia de la nación. De ahora en adelante es &quot;un reino dividido contra sí mismo&quot;. Mateo 12:25. Los dos reinos se reunirán en el futuro reino; Isaías 11:10-13; Jeremías 23:5,6; Ezequiel 37:15-28. Ver &quot;Reino&quot; (A.T.), (véase Scofield &quot;Génesis 1:26&quot;) véase Scofield &quot;Zacarías 12:8&quot;. (NT); Lucas 1:31; 1 Corintios 15:28. &quot;Israel&quot;; Génesis 12:2,3; Romanos 11:26.</p>","translation":{"sourceId":"scofield-2ch-10-16","status":"official","sourceLanguage":"en","targetLanguage":"es"}},{"id":"scofield-es-2ch-11-15","title":"2 Crónicas 11:15","author":"C. I. Scofield (1843–1921)","reference":{"book":"2CH","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>diablos lit. &quot;peludos&quot;, es decir, sátiros, Isaías 13:21.</p>","translation":{"sourceId":"scofield-2ch-11-15","status":"official","sourceLanguage":"en","targetLanguage":"es"}},{"id":"scofield-es-2ch-13-2","title":"2 Crónicas 13:2","author":"C. I. Scofield (1843–1921)","reference":{"book":"2CH","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>Micaías Probablemente nieto de Absalón, llamado Abisalom, Cf. 2 Crónicas 11:20; 1 Reyes 15:2.</p>","translation":{"sourceId":"scofield-2ch-13-2","status":"official","sourceLanguage":"en","targetLanguage":"es"}},{"id":"scofield-es-2ch-13-11","title":"2 Crónicas 13:11","author":"C. I. Scofield (1843–1921)","reference":{"book":"2CH","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>pan de la proposición (véase Scofield &quot;Éxodo 25:30&quot;).</p>","translation":{"sourceId":"scofield-2ch-13-11","status":"official","sourceLanguage":"en","targetLanguage":"es"}},{"id":"scofield-es-2ch-13-17","title":"2 Crónicas 13:17","author":"C. I. Scofield (1843–1921)","reference":{"book":"2CH","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>cinco (véase Scofield &quot;1 Corintios 10:8&quot;).</p>","translation":{"sourceId":"scofield-2ch-13-17","status":"official","sourceLanguage":"en","targetLanguage":"es"}},{"id":"scofield-es-2ch-14-3","title":"2 Crónicas 14:3","author":"C. I. Scofield (1843–1921)","reference":{"book":"2CH","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>lugares cf. (véase Scofield &quot;1 Reyes 3:2&quot;) véase Scofield &quot;1 Reyes 15:14&quot;. bosques sagrados (véase Scofield &quot;Deuteronomio 16:21&quot;) véase Scofield &quot;Jueces 3:7&quot;.</p>","translation":{"sourceId":"scofield-2ch-14-3","status":"official","sourceLanguage":"en","targetLanguage":"es"}},{"id":"scofield-es-2ch-14-8","title":"2 Crónicas 14:8","author":"C. I. Scofield (1843–1921)","reference":{"book":"2CH","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>trescientos mil (véase Scofield &quot;1 Corintios 10:8&quot;).</p>","translation":{"sourceId":"scofield-2ch-14-8","status":"official","sourceLanguage":"en","targetLanguage":"es"}},{"id":"scofield-es-2ch-15-8","title":"2 Crónicas 15:8","author":"C. I. Scofield (1843–1921)","reference":{"book":"2CH","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>cuando Asa Capítulo 14 describe la prosperidad exterior del reino y la reforma superficial de Asa; capítulo 15 la verdadera reforma.</p>","translation":{"sourceId":"scofield-2ch-15-8","status":"official","sourceLanguage":"en","targetLanguage":"es"}},{"id":"scofield-es-2ch-15-10","title":"2 Crónicas 15:10","author":"C. I. Scofield (1843–1921)","reference":{"book":"2CH","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>tercer mes, es decir, junio.</p>","translation":{"sourceId":"scofield-2ch-15-10","status":"official","sourceLanguage":"en","targetLanguage":"es"}},{"id":"scofield-es-2ch-15-16","title":"2 Crónicas 15:16","author":"C. I. Scofield (1843–1921)","reference":{"book":"2CH","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>madre, es decir, abuela. 1 Reyes 15:13, bosque sagrado (véase Scofield &quot;Deuteronomio 16:21&quot;). véase Scofield &quot;Jueces 3:7&quot;.</p>","translation":{"sourceId":"scofield-2ch-15-16","status":"official","sourceLanguage":"en","targetLanguage":"es"}},{"id":"scofield-es-2ch-15-17","title":"2 Crónicas 15:17","author":"C. I. Scofield (1843–1921)","reference":{"book":"2CH","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>Israel, es decir, el reino del norte o de diez tribus.</p>","translation":{"sourceId":"scofield-2ch-15-17","status":"official","sourceLanguage":"en","targetLanguage":"es"}},{"id":"scofield-es-2ch-16-1","title":"2 Crónicas 16:1","author":"C. I. Scofield (1843–1921)","reference":{"book":"2CH","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>a Asa, es decir, a ninguno de sus súbditos. 2 Crónicas 16:5,6; 15:9.</p>","translation":{"sourceId":"scofield-2ch-16-1","status":"official","sourceLanguage":"en","targetLanguage":"es"}},{"id":"scofield-es-2ch-17-3","title":"2 Crónicas 17:3","author":"C. I. Scofield (1843–1921)","reference":{"book":"2CH","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>padre Según la costumbre judía de llamar padre a un jefe de familia o de tribu; p.ej. Juan 8:53.</p>","translation":{"sourceId":"scofield-2ch-17-3","status":"official","sourceLanguage":"en","targetLanguage":"es"}},{"id":"scofield-es-2ch-17-4","title":"2 Crónicas 17:4","author":"C. I. Scofield (1843–1921)","reference":{"book":"2CH","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>Israel, es decir, el reino de diez tribus.</p>","translation":{"sourceId":"scofield-2ch-17-4","status":"official","sourceLanguage":"en","targetLanguage":"es"}},{"id":"scofield-es-2ch-17-6","title":"2 Crónicas 17:6","author":"C. I. Scofield (1843–1921)","reference":{"book":"2CH","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>lugares altos (véase Scofield &quot;1 Reyes 3:2&quot;). bosques sagrados (véase Scofield &quot;Deuteronomio 16:21&quot;) véase Scofield &quot;Jueces 3:7&quot;.</p>","translation":{"sourceId":"scofield-2ch-17-6","status":"official","sourceLanguage":"en","targetLanguage":"es"}},{"id":"scofield-es-2ch-17-14","title":"2 Crónicas 17:14","author":"C. I. Scofield (1843–1921)","reference":{"book":"2CH","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>trescientos mil (véase Scofield &quot;1 Corintios 10:8&quot;).</p>","translation":{"sourceId":"scofield-2ch-17-14","status":"official","sourceLanguage":"en","targetLanguage":"es"}},{"id":"scofield-es-2ch-19-3","title":"2 Crónicas 19:3","author":"C. I. Scofield (1843–1921)","reference":{"book":"2CH","chapterStart":19,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":19,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>bosques sagrados (véase Scofield &quot;Deuteronomio 16:21&quot;). véase Scofield &quot;Jueces 3:7&quot;.</p>","translation":{"sourceId":"scofield-2ch-19-3","status":"official","sourceLanguage":"en","targetLanguage":"es"}},{"id":"scofield-es-2ch-19-9","title":"2 Crónicas 19:9","author":"C. I. Scofield (1843–1921)","reference":{"book":"2CH","chapterStart":19,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":19,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>miedo (véase Scofield &quot;Salmo 19:9&quot;).</p>","translation":{"sourceId":"scofield-2ch-19-9","status":"official","sourceLanguage":"en","targetLanguage":"es"}},{"id":"scofield-es-2ch-20-33","title":"2 Crónicas 20:33","author":"C. I. Scofield (1843–1921)","reference":{"book":"2CH","chapterStart":20,"verseStart":33,"chapterEnd":20,"verseEnd":33},"content":"<p>lugares altos (véase Scofield &quot;1 Reyes 3:2&quot;).</p>","translation":{"sourceId":"scofield-2ch-20-33","status":"official","sourceLanguage":"en","targetLanguage":"es"}},{"id":"scofield-es-2ch-21-1","title":"2 Crónicas 21:1","author":"C. I. Scofield (1843–1921)","reference":{"book":"2CH","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>Joram Joram reinó por un tiempo como co-rey con su padre. 2 Reyes 8:16.</p>","translation":{"sourceId":"scofield-2ch-21-1","status":"official","sourceLanguage":"en","targetLanguage":"es"}},{"id":"scofield-es-2ch-21-5","title":"2 Crónicas 21:5","author":"C. I. Scofield (1843–1921)","reference":{"book":"2CH","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>Comenzó Comenzó, es decir, como co-rey. 2 Crónicas 22:2 (véase Scofield &quot;2 Crónicas 21:1&quot;).</p>","translation":{"sourceId":"scofield-2ch-21-5","status":"official","sourceLanguage":"en","targetLanguage":"es"}},{"id":"scofield-es-2ch-21-12","title":"2 Crónicas 21:12","author":"C. I. Scofield (1843–1921)","reference":{"book":"2CH","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>Elías Ver la historia de Elías. 1 Reyes 17:1; 2 Reyes 2:12.</p>","translation":{"sourceId":"scofield-2ch-21-12","status":"official","sourceLanguage":"en","targetLanguage":"es"}},{"id":"scofield-es-2ch-21-17","title":"2 Crónicas 21:17","author":"C. I. Scofield (1843–1921)","reference":{"book":"2CH","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>Joacaz llamado Ocozías, 2 Crónicas 22:1,6 y Azarías:</p>","translation":{"sourceId":"scofield-2ch-21-17","status":"official","sourceLanguage":"en","targetLanguage":"es"}},{"id":"scofield-es-2ch-22-1","title":"2 Crónicas 22:1","author":"C. I. Scofield (1843–1921)","reference":{"book":"2CH","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>Ocozías donde se le llama Joacaz. 2 Crónicas 21:17.</p>","translation":{"sourceId":"scofield-2ch-22-1","status":"official","sourceLanguage":"en","targetLanguage":"es"}},{"id":"scofield-es-2ch-24-18","title":"2 Crónicas 24:18","author":"C. I. Scofield (1843–1921)","reference":{"book":"2CH","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>bosques sagrados (véase Scofield &quot;Deuteronomio 16:21&quot;). véase Scofield &quot;Jueces 3:7&quot;.</p>","translation":{"sourceId":"scofield-2ch-24-18","status":"official","sourceLanguage":"en","targetLanguage":"es"}},{"id":"scofield-es-2ch-25-7","title":"2 Crónicas 25:7","author":"C. I. Scofield (1843–1921)","reference":{"book":"2CH","chapterStart":25,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":25,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>Efraín Usado en sentido colectivo para el reino de diez tribus del norte, llamado también &quot;Israel&quot;.</p>","translation":{"sourceId":"scofield-2ch-25-7","status":"official","sourceLanguage":"en","targetLanguage":"es"}},{"id":"scofield-es-2ch-29-3","title":"2 Crónicas 29:3","author":"C. I. Scofield (1843–1921)","reference":{"book":"2CH","chapterStart":29,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":29,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>primer mes, es decir, abril.</p>","translation":{"sourceId":"scofield-2ch-29-3","status":"official","sourceLanguage":"en","targetLanguage":"es"}},{"id":"scofield-es-2ch-29-17","title":"2 Crónicas 29:17","author":"C. I. Scofield (1843–1921)","reference":{"book":"2CH","chapterStart":29,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":29,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>primer mes, es decir, abril.</p>","translation":{"sourceId":"scofield-2ch-29-17","status":"official","sourceLanguage":"en","targetLanguage":"es"}},{"id":"scofield-es-2ch-29-18","title":"2 Crónicas 29:18","author":"C. I. Scofield (1843–1921)","reference":{"book":"2CH","chapterStart":29,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":29,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>pan de la proposición (véase Scofield &quot;Éxodo 25:30&quot;).</p>","translation":{"sourceId":"scofield-2ch-29-18","status":"official","sourceLanguage":"en","targetLanguage":"es"}},{"id":"scofield-es-2ch-29-24","title":"2 Crónicas 29:24","author":"C. I. Scofield (1843–1921)","reference":{"book":"2CH","chapterStart":29,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":29,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>reconciliación O, una ofrenda. (véase Scofield &quot;Daniel 9:24&quot;) expiación (véase Scofield &quot;Éxodo 29:33&quot;).</p>","translation":{"sourceId":"scofield-2ch-29-24","status":"official","sourceLanguage":"en","targetLanguage":"es"}},{"id":"scofield-es-2ch-30-2","title":"2 Crónicas 30:2","author":"C. I. Scofield (1843–1921)","reference":{"book":"2CH","chapterStart":30,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":30,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>segundo mes, es decir, mayo; 2 Crónicas 30:13,15.</p>","translation":{"sourceId":"scofield-2ch-30-2","status":"official","sourceLanguage":"en","targetLanguage":"es"}},{"id":"scofield-es-2ch-31-1","title":"2 Crónicas 31:1","author":"C. I. Scofield (1843–1921)","reference":{"book":"2CH","chapterStart":31,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":31,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>bosques sagrados (véase Scofield &quot;Jueces 3:7&quot;).</p>","translation":{"sourceId":"scofield-2ch-31-1","status":"official","sourceLanguage":"en","targetLanguage":"es"}},{"id":"scofield-es-2ch-31-7","title":"2 Crónicas 31:7","author":"C. I. Scofield (1843–1921)","reference":{"book":"2CH","chapterStart":31,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":31,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>tercer mes, es decir, junio. séptimo mes, es decir, octubre.</p>","translation":{"sourceId":"scofield-2ch-31-7","status":"official","sourceLanguage":"en","targetLanguage":"es"}},{"id":"scofield-es-2ch-32-5","title":"2 Crónicas 32:5","author":"C. I. Scofield (1843–1921)","reference":{"book":"2CH","chapterStart":32,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":32,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>También él Cf. Isaías 22:1-13 La visión divina en este momento:</p>","translation":{"sourceId":"scofield-2ch-32-5","status":"official","sourceLanguage":"en","targetLanguage":"es"}},{"id":"scofield-es-2ch-32-12","title":"2 Crónicas 32:12","author":"C. I. Scofield (1843–1921)","reference":{"book":"2CH","chapterStart":32,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":32,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>lugares altos (véase Scofield &quot;1 Reyes 3:2&quot;).</p>","translation":{"sourceId":"scofield-2ch-32-12","status":"official","sourceLanguage":"en","targetLanguage":"es"}},{"id":"scofield-es-2ch-34-3","title":"2 Crónicas 34:3","author":"C. I. Scofield (1843–1921)","reference":{"book":"2CH","chapterStart":34,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":34,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>bosques sagrados (véase Scofield &quot;Deuteronomio 16:21&quot;) véase Scofield &quot;Jueces 3:7&quot;.</p>","translation":{"sourceId":"scofield-2ch-34-3","status":"official","sourceLanguage":"en","targetLanguage":"es"}},{"id":"scofield-es-2ch-34-7","title":"2 Crónicas 34:7","author":"C. I. Scofield (1843–1921)","reference":{"book":"2CH","chapterStart":34,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":34,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>bosques sagrados (véase Scofield &quot;Deuteronomio 16:21&quot;). véase Scofield &quot;Jueces 3:7&quot;.</p>","translation":{"sourceId":"scofield-2ch-34-7","status":"official","sourceLanguage":"en","targetLanguage":"es"}},{"id":"scofield-es-2ch-35-1","title":"2 Crónicas 35:1","author":"C. I. Scofield (1843–1921)","reference":{"book":"2CH","chapterStart":35,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":35,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>primer mes, es decir, abril.</p>","translation":{"sourceId":"scofield-2ch-35-1","status":"official","sourceLanguage":"en","targetLanguage":"es"}},{"id":"scofield-es-2ch-36-6","title":"2 Crónicas 36:6","author":"C. I. Scofield (1843–1921)","reference":{"book":"2CH","chapterStart":36,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":36,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>subió Ver 2 Reyes 24:1-6; Jeremías 25:1-9; Daniel 1:1; Habacuc 1:6. Esta fue la primera deportación de Judá. Ver 2 Crónicas 36:15-21, la deportación final:</p>","translation":{"sourceId":"scofield-2ch-36-6","status":"official","sourceLanguage":"en","targetLanguage":"es"}}]}
